From 68c1997b898caedddac94a2c2f646f4634a9dacc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Jan 2023 17:21:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 158/572] feat(stm32mp2): save encryption key info before
 overwriting DT

To give more space when loading other binaries in SYSRAM, the BL2 DT
is overwritten when loading BL31. All the required information from
this DT must then be saved before. This is the case for encrytion key
details (OTP index and length). The function
stm32_get_enc_key_otp_idx_len() is then called before overwriting DT.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 3533275c6024d38e014f98bdee973fae987fa11c feat(stm32mp2): save encryption key info before overwriting DT]
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I38f0be56f10868e24dd71a1ea5bd27aff35196da
---
 plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c b/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c
index 10a05ebb8a..5c21f82554 100644
--- a/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c
+++ b/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c
@@ -339,6 +339,8 @@ int bl2_plat_handle_post_image_load(unsigned int image_id)
 		BL33_IMAGE_ID,
 		HW_CONFIG_ID,
 	};
+	uint32_t otp_idx __maybe_unused;
+	uint32_t otp_len __maybe_unused;
 
 	assert(bl_mem_params != NULL);
 
@@ -413,6 +415,14 @@ int bl2_plat_handle_post_image_load(unsigned int image_id)
 			}
 		}
 
+#ifndef DECRYPTION_SUPPORT_none
+		/* Load encryption key info before DT is unmapped */
+		err = stm32_get_enc_key_otp_idx_len(&otp_idx, &otp_len);
+		if (err != 0) {
+			panic();
+		}
+#endif
+
 		/*
 		 * After this step, the BL2 device tree area will be overwritten
 		 * with BL31 binary, no other data should be read from BL2 DT.
-- 
2.53.0

